   <section id="about">  

   	<div class="row section-intro">
   		<div class="col-twelve">

   			
   			<h1>ABOUT CUCINELLO</h1>

   			<div class="intro-info">

   			

   				<p class="lead">Lanificio Cucinello is the creative unison of rich legacy, contemporary designs and sheer elegance.
				Established in early 1900s, Cucinello is one of the finest integrated woolen textile mills in Biella (Italy). During the course of time, 
				Mr. Doady Vigna took over the mill and is now the principal architect of the company. Lanificio Cucinello under his vast experience and
				expertise has grown to become of the first textile design house, producing and commissioning some of the finest fabrics available in the
				world, primarily from Italy.</p>
   			</div>   			

   		</div>   		
